# Bash vs PowerShell line continuation

## Symptom
Pandoc command fails with:
Missing expression after unary operator '--'

## Root Cause
Used "\" line continuation in PowerShell instead of Bash.

## Fix
PowerShell:
pandoc input.md `
  --css=styles.css `
  --standalone

Bash:
pandoc input.md \
  --css=styles.css \
  --standalone

## Guardrail
Pick ONE shell per repo. Set default terminal in VS Code.

## Context
MythEngine slides build.

